    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Traditional turnbased combat with 4 person party<br></li><li>Handpainted art for the character portraits<br></li><li>360 degree rotatable camera within 3D enviroment, with plenty of emphasis on hidden items and secrets thanks to this</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Plot</strong><br><br>Strangers of the Power 3 tells a story about a woman named Marion who has gift of healing. This gift made her want to become an adventurer. After passing the trials, her first job is less than a glamorous one; take care of a critter problem that a city has. <br><br>However, this seemingly simple first job takes a turn for worse that threatens the lives of many people, potentially changing the lives of everyone around Marion\u2026",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Plot</strong><br><br>Strangers of the Power 3 tells a story about a woman named Marion who has gift of healing. This gift made her want to become an adventurer. After passing the trials, her first job is less than a glamorous one; take care of a critter problem that a city has. <br><br>However, this seemingly simple first job takes a turn for worse that threatens the lives of many people, potentially changing the lives of everyone around Marion\u2026",
    "short_description": "Young adventurer's trial by fire gets out of hand and threatens the lives of multiple people.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cStrangers of the Power 3 is a good adventure rpg indie game, nice execution, classic turn-based combat system, pretty characters and design (dont forget to rotate the camera to discover items). Fun!\u201d<br>Games without Borders<br><br>\u201cIt's the 1st 3D game with 360 degree camera movements among Tuomo's games. It features a classic turn-based JRPG. It reminds us of PS1 game titles. You can experience Tuomo's unique sense in this game\u201d<br>Nyanco Channel<br>",
